[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0363","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0363.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-40277","title":"Linux kernel drm/vmwgfx 命令标头大小验证不当导致越界访问漏洞","description":"Linux 内核的 drm/vmwgfx 显卡驱动中存在命令标头大小验证缺失漏洞。由于未对来自用户空间的命令标头大小与 SVGA_CMD_MAX_DATASIZE 进行校验，攻击者可构造特制的命令数据触发缓冲区偏移计算整数溢出，导致越界内存访问，进而可能造成系统崩溃或权限提升。该漏洞需要本地用户权限才能利用，影响使用 VMware 图形驱动的 Linux 系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-40277"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2025-12-06T22:15:55Z","updated":"2026-06-17T09:21:34Z","remediation":"立即更新 Linux 内核至包含提交 `drm/vmwgfx: Validate command header size against SVGA_CMD_MAX_DATASIZE` 的版本。Ubuntu 24.04 LTS 升级 linux-oem-6.17 至 6.17.0-1011.11（USN-8048-1），Ubuntu 25.10 升级 linux-image 至 6.17.0-14.14（USN-8029-1）。RHEL 8/9/10 分别安装 RHSA-2026:1148/RHSA-2026:0793/RHSA-2026:0453 对应内核更新。Debian 11 应用 DLA-4404-1。更新后重启系统生效。临时缓解措施：如无需 VMware 图形功能，可执行 `echo \"blacklist vmwgfx\" > /etc/modprobe.d/blacklist-vmwgfx.conf` 禁用该内核模块。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/32b415a9dc2c212e809b7ebc2b14bc3fbda2b9af","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/54d458b244893e47bda52ec3943fdfbc8d7d068b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5aea2cde03d4247cdcf53f9ab7d0747c9dca1cfc","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/709e5c088f9c99a5cf2c1d1c6ce58f2cca7ab173","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a3abb54c27b2c393c44362399777ad2f6e1ff17e","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b5df9e06eed3df6a4f5c6f8453013b0cabb927b4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e58559845021c3bad5e094219378b869157fad53","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/f3f3a8eb3f0ba799fae057091d8c67cca12d6fa0","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2025/40xxx/CVE-2025-40277.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-40277","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2b9f82473296f370428cbc110ec5b988e3fd692/2025/40xxx/CVE-2025-40277.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2025-40277.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2025-40277.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/16/seguranca/cve-2025-40277-drmvmwgfx-validate-command-header-s-1765895893000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/12/GHSA-6jjc-g279-fq4c/GHSA-6jjc-g279-fq4c.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-40277","https://github.com/ellis-wilson-ms/co-lustre/blob/9b5f6a3950a962354660e4b5c3fc6e3ed91ce952/processed/jira/txt/LU/LU-19752.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-40277.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0363.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0587","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0587.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14104","title":"红帽 util-linux 堆缓冲区读溢出漏洞","description":"在util-linux库中存在一个堆缓冲区过读漏洞，具体位于setpwnam()函数。该漏洞通过处理256字节用户名时触发，当写入密码数据库的SUID登录工具日志时，导致缓冲区越界读取。攻击者需本地访问权限，通过精心构造的用户名即可触发此漏洞。漏洞影响广泛的Linux系统，因SUID登录工具写入密码文件，可能被利用实现局部权限升级，将系统权限提升到Root。通过精心构造用户名利用setpwnam()的缓冲区溢出特性，攻击者可以在系统用户环境下执行远程代码控制，威胁用户数据安全。在CVSS 3.1下的评分达到6.1，中等风险级别，建议尽快修复","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14104"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-05T17:16:03Z","updated":"2026-06-30T00:16:53Z","remediation":"升级 util-linux 到 2.39 及以上版本以获取 upstream 修复 commit 9a36d77012c4c771f8d51eba46b6e62c29bf572a 补丁，或者直接应用 Home Assistant buildroot 发布的 CVE-2025-14104 补丁（包 0008/0009）。Ubuntu 用户请安装 USN-7187-1，Red Hat 用户请安装 RHSA-2026:1696 等安全更新包。如果无法立即升级，可通过 PAM 配置限制本地用户名长度 ≤255 字节以缓解攻击风险","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1696","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1852","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:1913","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:2485","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:2563","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:2737","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:2800","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:3406","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:4943","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2026:7180","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2025-14104","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2419369","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/debf0490813d6b24b6eb78e22c421b3f9bcb8d50/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14104.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/7e48ebbcec9e3d29e1565bd7d31349c1f27c7348/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14104.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-14104.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6f07feba024060bc836e38e9ad4be74bb9614ec/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14104.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/0afc50966abea531bd479eddeffd4126ecf86907/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-14104.json","https://github.com/LearningCircuit/local-deep-research/blob/6dc27f73ad2b3ef3e1a182953bb118570e044e7d/.trivyignore","https://github.com/home-assistant/buildroot/blob/dfa1d775aa4f26502c4214516050117192aeff12/package/util-linux/0009-CVE-2025-14104-2.patch","https://github.com/home-assistant/buildroot/blob/dfa1d775aa4f26502c4214516050117192aeff12/package/util-linux/0008-CVE-2025-14104-1.patch","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-14104.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/e03c5655bebd4c9a948dcb1b37e1e76b72295ca6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-14104"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0587.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0507","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0507.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12385","title":"Qt 文本组件解析器 img 标签大小验证不当漏洞","description":"Qt 公司的 Qt Quick 框架中的 Text 文本组件解析器在处理 `<img>` 标签时，未对图片的 width 和 height 属性进行有效验证，存在资源无限制分配漏洞（CWE-770）。远程攻击者可通过构造包含超大尺寸属性的恶意 `<img>` 标签的富文本内容，诱导目标用户解析该内容，导致 Qt 应用程序分配过量内存资源，最终造成界面无响应或进程崩溃。该漏洞影响 Qt 5.0.0 至 6.5.10、6.6.0 至 6.8.5 以及 6.9.0 至 6.10.0 版本，覆盖 Windows、macOS、Linux、iOS、Android 等多平台，CVSS v4.0 评分 8.7，危害等级高。攻击者无需身份认证，仅需用户浏览或加载特制文本内容即可触发拒绝服务。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12385"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-04T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-12-04T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Qt 至 6.5.11+、6.8.6+ 或 6.10.1+ 版本，或从 Qt 官方 Gerrit 合入补丁 https://codereview.qt-project.org/c/qt/qtdeclarative/+/687239 和 +/687766。如无法立即升级，可在应用层对用户输入的 &lt;img&gt; 标签宽高值做上限校验（如限制 width/height ≤ 4096 像素）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12385.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/95f29039d9df9f64ea752bc1ef04de2ad5981e05/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12385.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12385.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12385.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-12385.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-12385.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-123xx/CVE-2025-12385.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-12385","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2025-12385","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-12385.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0507.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0538","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0538.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12819","title":"PgBouncer auth_query 搜索路径不受信任漏洞","description":"PgBouncer 1.25.1 之前版本的 auth_query 连接处理器中存在不受信任的搜索路径漏洞 (CWE-426)。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可在 PostgreSQL 认证阶段，通过在 StartupMessage 中注入恶意的 search_path 参数，劫持 auth_query 查询的搜索路径，从而执行任意 SQL 语句。该漏洞影响 PgBouncer 1.25.1 之前的所有版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.5 (HIGH)，攻击向量为网络 (AV:N)，攻击复杂度高 (AC:H)，需要低权限 (PR:L)，无需用户交互 (UI:N)，可导致机密性、完整性、可用性均受到高度影响 (C:H/I:H/A:H)。攻击者需具备数据库连接权限，通过构造恶意的 search_path 参数劫持搜索路径，在认证阶段注入并执行任意 SQL 代码，可能导致数据库数据泄露、篡改或破坏。PgBouncer 1.25.1 已修复此漏洞，建议尽快升级至 1.25.1 或更高版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12819"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-03T19:15:55Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:33:00Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 PgBouncer 至 1.25.1 或更高版本（官方已发布修复版本）。若暂时无法升级，可通过以下方式临时缓解：1) 在 pgbouncer.ini 中禁用 auth_query（设为空或注释掉），改用 auth_file 或 auth_type=trust/md5/scram-sha-256 等不依赖 auth_query 的认证方式；2) 在防火墙层面限制 PgBouncer 监听端口（默认 6432）仅允许受信任客户端 IP 访问；3) 确保 PostgreSQL 端口（默认 5432）不直接暴露在公网。升级后请重启 PgBouncer 服务使配置生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.pgbouncer.org/changelog.html#pgbouncer-125x","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/12/msg00033.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f38c5fdc2d5ae016cb5ff615cdaf3941dc98e9f4/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12819.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/279583be34c6d843b0dc5c18439662dc1902e505/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12819.json","https://github.com/EnterpriseDB/docs/blob/507b9d6dd498f598e319dd17f5edc6450567cb32/advocacy_docs/security/assessments/cve-2025-12819.mdx","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12819.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12819.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2025/CVE-2025-12819.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/54b256cb2952e60dcd1a90ef7455fbfb2b786625/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-12819.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-12819.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/54b256cb2952e60dcd1a90ef7455fbfb2b786625/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-12819.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-12819.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0538.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0499","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0499.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12084","title":"Python CPython xml.dom.minidom 节点 ID 缓存清除二次复杂度算法缺陷导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Python 标准库 xml.dom.minidom 模块在构建嵌套 XML 元素时，调用 appendChild() 等依赖 _clear_id_cache() 的方法会导致算法复杂度呈二次方增长。当处理深度嵌套的 XML 文档时，该缺陷会消耗大量 CPU 资源，造成服务可用性下降。攻击者可通过提交特制的深度嵌套 XML 文档触发此漏洞，导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Python 3.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12084"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-03T19:15:55Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:31:41Z","remediation":"升级 Python CPython 至 3.10.20、3.11.15、3.12.13、3.13.11、3.14.2 或 3.15.0a3 及以上版本，这些版本已修复 _clear_id_cache() 的二次复杂度问题。如无法立即升级，可在应用层限制 XML 文档嵌套深度作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/027f21e417