e":"2025/AVE-2025-0577.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13721","title":"Google Chrome V8 引擎竞态条件导致堆损坏漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 浏览器在 V8 JavaScript 引擎中存在一个竞态条件漏洞（CWE-362）。由于 V8 引擎在处理并发请求时缺乏适当的同步机制，远程攻击者可以通过诱导用户访问一个精心构造的 HTML 页面，在特定执行时序下触发竞态条件，从而导致堆内存损坏（Heap Corruption）。该漏洞的影响范围包括 143.0.7499.41 版本之前的 Google Chrome 浏览器，成功利用后可能导致远程代码执行（RCE）或使攻击者获得目标系统的更高权限。攻击条件为用户需通过浏览器加载恶意网页，且需满足特定的并发执行时序。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13721"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-02T19:15:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:34:38Z","remediation":"建议将 Google Chrome 浏览器升级至 143.0.7499.41 或更高版本。对于 Fedora 用户，请更新至 chromium-143.0.7499.146 及 cef-143.0.10+g8aed01b 版本以修复 v8 引擎中的竞态条件漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/12/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/355120682","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13721.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/8aa3fb6edbc01998fa6469125b06f34b431f0aea/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13721.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13721.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13721.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/623e12f4150ecd716e9b256ef9b2048c8bc52c64/data/2025/CVE-2025-13721.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b9dba67c94bbc6d24eae4b34e0cd3767069dd513/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-13721.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13721.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-13721.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/418f362bf2ed654c73aee7f7f643d90e21e1b6c2/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-13721.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/785d709d514558e172acbeb4efdb10760478ab87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-137xx/CVE-2025-13721.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0577.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0576","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0576.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13720","title":"Google Chrome 浏览器 Loader 组件堆损坏漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 浏览器的 Loader 组件中存在一个类型转换错误（Bad Cast）漏洞。当远程攻击者成功攻破渲染进程后，可以通过诱导用户访问精心构造的 HTML 页面，触发该漏洞导致堆损坏（Heap Corruption）。该漏洞影响 143.0.7499.41 之前的 Google Chrome 版本，攻击者可利用此缺陷在受影响系统中实现潜在的内存破坏或权限提升。建议用户尽快升级至官方发布的最新版本以消除安全风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13720"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-02T19:15:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:34:38Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Google Chrome 浏览器升级至 143.0.7499.41 或更高版本（如 143.0.7499.146）。用户可通过浏览器设置中的“关于 Google Chrome”检查更新并自动安装最新补丁，以修复 Loader 中由于错误类型转换导致的堆损坏漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/12/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/457818670","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13720.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/8aa3fb6edbc01998fa6469125b06f34b431f0aea/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13720.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13720.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13720.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/623e12f4150ecd716e9b256ef9b2048c8bc52c64/data/2025/CVE-2025-13720.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/b9dba67c94bbc6d24eae4b34e0cd3767069dd513/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-13720.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13720.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-13720.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/418f362bf2ed654c73aee7f7f643d90e21e1b6c2/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-13720.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/785d709d514558e172acbeb4efdb10760478ab87/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-137xx/CVE-2025-13720.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0576.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0571","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0571.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13640","title":"Google Chrome 密码模块不当实现导致的认证绕过漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 密码模块存在不当实现漏洞，版本 prior to 143.0.7499.41 受影响。攻击者需通过物理接触设备，利用密码模块的实现缺陷绕过身份验证机制，从而获取未经授权的访问权限。该漏洞危害等级较低，攻击条件要求攻击者具备设备的物理访问权限，无需网络交互或特权提升即可触发。","severity":"LOW","score":3.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13640"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-02T19:15:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:34:30Z","remediation":"升级 Google Chrome 至 143.0.7499.41 或更高版本以修复密码模块认证绕过漏洞。Fedora/RHEL 用户可更新 chromium 包至 143.0.7499.146（参考 rhbz#2423482）。在无法立即升级的情况下，限制物理访问权限并启用操作系统登录认证作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/12/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/452071826","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cd696685415f2042291d9e0384b081621f3c1f4b/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13640.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/be81f8dae22a1c5cb1075bd56250b18198b34aea/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13640.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ef75ce172dfcb1356ff39d845afc3279616b6768/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13640.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/be745c1ea7b9b91e65f3d64ef3f756698bb41557/data/2025/CVE-2025-13640.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob