iew 模块存在不当实现漏洞，在 143.0.7499.41 之前的版本中，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造恶意域名，诱导用户执行特定的 UI 手势操作，从而实施 UI 欺骗攻击。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 Chromium 的浏览器发行版，攻击者利用精心设计的域名欺骗用户界面，使用户误以为其正在与可信站点交互。CVSS 评分为 4.3（中等），利用条件为需要用户主动参与 UI 手势交互。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13636"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-02T19:15:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:34:29Z","remediation":"建议将 Google Chrome 浏览器升级至 143.0.7499.41 或更高版本。对于使用 Fedora 42 的用户，请执行系统更新，将 chromium 软件包升级至 143.0.7499.146 版本，以修复分屏视图（Split View）中可能导致 UI 欺骗的实现缺陷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/12/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/446181124","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/231116aa5795023b4be954f9aed84939e97cf046/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13636.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/077172bcea3338bafb871871e211bbb7c87f3c3c/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13636.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13636.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13636.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/be745c1ea7b9b91e65f3d64ef3f756698bb41557/data/2025/CVE-2025-13636.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/d2420392e74d53848b4edd8107521966d8d48c20/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-13636.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13636.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-13636.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/b78a15b07d7cb16546143e956ec58c7d8490f0c9/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-13636.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b01d01b655cac08088621898fd70278524e2f0e/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-136xx/CVE-2025-13636.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0567.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0566","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0566.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13635","title":"Google Chrome 下载功能 UI 欺骗漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于 Google Chrome 的下载组件中，由于下载功能的实现不当，导致浏览器在处理特定文件下载时未能正确隔离或验证 UI 元素。本地攻击者可以通过诱导用户访问一个精心构造的 HTML 页面，利用此缺陷实现 UI 欺骗（UI Spoofing），从而误导用户执行非预期操作或伪造系统界面。该漏洞影响 143.0.7499.41 之前的 Google Chrome 版本，CVSS 评分 4.4，危害等级为中低危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.4,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13635"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-02T19:15:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:34:29Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Google Chrome 浏览器升级至 143.0.7499.41 或更高版本。对于使用 Chromium 衍生版本（如 Fedora 上的 CEF/Chromium）的用户，应更新至 chromium-143.0.7499.146 或更新的发行版补丁版本，以修复下载组件中的实现缺陷，防止本地攻击者通过构造 HTML 页面进行 UI 欺骗。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/12/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/405727341","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/33ec434954e61bc39d0dce97d60b798545efd141/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13635.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9aee4694c57e6f549d7f2ae075baefe98f4ec05f/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13635.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13635.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13635.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/55f246b77910d3f4b9407285be2bf5a1d8726efb/data/2025/CVE-2025-13635.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/d2420392e74d53848b4edd8107521966d8d48c20/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-13635.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13635.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-13635.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/b78a15b07d7cb16546143e956ec58c7d8490f0c9/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-13635.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b01d01b655cac08088621898fd70278524e2f0e/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-136xx/CVE-2025-13635.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0566.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0565","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0565.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13634","title":"Google Chrome 下载功能实现不当导致的安全机制绕过漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 在 Windows 平台的下载功能实现中存在逻辑缺陷。本地攻击者可通过诱导用户访问一个精心构造的 HTML 页面，利用该实现不当的问题绕过浏览器的“网络标记”（Mark of the Web, MotW）安全机制。MotW 旨在标识文件来源自互联网并触发相应的安全警告，一旦被绕过，原本应被标记为潜在危险的下载文件将被视为本地受信文件，从而降低系统的安全防御能力。该漏洞影响版本低于 143.0.7499.41 的 Google Chrome 浏览器，攻击条件为用户触发特定页面交互，影响范围为 Windows 平台用户。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.4,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13634"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-12-02T19:15:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:34:29Z","remediation":"建议将 Google Chrome 浏览器升级至 143.0.7499.41 或更高版本。用户可通过点击浏览器右上角“三点”菜单 $\\rightarrow$ “帮助” $\\rightarrow$ “关于 Google Chrome”触发自动更新并重启浏览器以完成修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/12/stable-channel-update-for-desktop.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/429140219","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/33ec434954e61bc39d0dce97d60b798545efd141/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13634.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9aee4694c57e6f549d7f2ae075baefe98f4ec05f/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13634.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13634.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/55f246b77910d3f4b9407285be2bf5a1d8726efb/data/2025/CVE-2025-13634.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/d2420392e74d53848b4edd810752196